				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>仮メッセージ
４番道路　Ｗ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:12:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
